  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R08 establishes Linkage from the shared shipping address. The home-address household exception does not apply because the registration is too recent. No earlier outcome settles the order. Linkage is the sole adverse family, initially placing the order under §6.6(b). The required id_check has failed, so §5.3(b) now decides: escalate is standard, with decline also permitted. Recommend escalation before shipment, including linked-account handling within §2.5. Household sharing remains a plausible explanation for the address overlap, but it does not override the failed verification. No further check is needed."
